-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §12: a teaching employee who worked in a
-- reform school and moved to one the reform has not reached stays under the
-- reform's terms.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `12`

@ref akn:art_12
GIVEN `worked in a reform school` IS A BOOLEAN, `now in a school the reform has not reached` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `stays under the reform` `worked in a reform school` `now in a school the reform has not reached` IF
    `worked in a reform school`

#ASSERT `stays under the reform` TRUE TRUE
